Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're so dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:09.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, it won't work !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're too slow, we can't dodge !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:39.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come with me !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bringing you along
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,gives me more cards to play for my safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master is too generous to it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.84,0:04:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,for gathering so many underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Guard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:32.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:38.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bag of holding is no longer sealed by Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:40.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means Hunchback Meng is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:48.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Top-quality spirit stones !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This cauldron
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:07.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,was the treasure of a rank 3 country:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Medicine King Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hunchback Meng killed its owner, took the cauldron,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:13.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and made it his life artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,He tempered it for thousands of years with his life energy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to forge it into the Poison King Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its spiritual energy is poisonous,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,that green mist can destroy Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although this treasure is dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:29.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I use it properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will help me leave this place safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:52.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,An artifact made from a Soul Formation's life artifact !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:57.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This poison sword
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,can poison a Nascent Soul with a single hit !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It would leave them at death's door !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what if it has many underlings ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:22.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's so great about you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll get some underlings very soon too !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Check the surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earth Trial:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bridge of No Return
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:55.56,Message,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)\pos(912,482)}Earth Trial: Bridge of No Return\N\NI have passed through the Earth Trial and killed its king before reaching this Road of No Return. This place is very interesting, if anyone in the future sees this, then consider it fate.\N\NCarefully ponder the meaning of 'No Return'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,No Return ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Carefully ponder the meaning of 'No Return'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is there such a message here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,No Return...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:06.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,No Return...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does it mean that once you step on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:10.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,you cannot come back ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master still values me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,wouldn't he let Number Two do the job ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:28.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing's wrong here !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:41.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:53.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The devil was fine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the beast wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:58.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The devil is somewhat of a special entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It means that every living being
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,that steps on this bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:33.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're gone ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Desolate Beast !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:21.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it really were a Desolate Beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:23.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,a single breath would've blown me away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:27.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,not make my clothes flutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,My son...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've lost weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:43.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:45.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,didn’t we bring something for Tie Zhu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:51.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother brought your favorite spiced beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,My son,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,come and take it !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:59.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,didn't you love your mom's spiced beef ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,An illusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:03.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin dared to kill my grandson
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I'll exterminate his entire family !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:18.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save your father !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why won't you turn around to save us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:28.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turn around and look at your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could you be so heartless ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.32,0:11:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't you turn your head ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I crushed the Divine Sense Bead you gave us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,come back now !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:42.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even facing death, my parents never crushed the Divine Sense Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:54.84,Second,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:56.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg you !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're not my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:12:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father and Mother protected me until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why would they make me turn back here now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg you !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is all an illusion !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Bridge of No Return was very dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.64,0:12:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a restriction !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:14.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This restriction is very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.32,0:13:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,that this place is covered in restrictions ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a restriction mountain !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems this second trial
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,requires me to climb this restriction mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, over here !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone was here before me !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:13:59.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're lucky for having me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,protect you all the way up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:34.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The core of this Ancient God's restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:35.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is indeed beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:11.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yi'er did not fail you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I diligently studied restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,during the past 1000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)\pos(242,618)}1000 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yi'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:22.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a restriction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second trial
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:38.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is called Restriction Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mountain is covered in restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:47.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,this restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,looks somewhat similar to a formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,A restriction is a type of formation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:56.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,but way more flexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:59.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can bend according to the cultivator's will
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:01.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,in an infinite number of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Restrictions are more like Divine Sense in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,A powerful cultivator can place restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,just with their Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as that Divine Sense remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,the restriction will continue to operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:18.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The simplest way to break a restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to use brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this method requires having a high cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The higher you climb,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:28.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the more complex and powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,the restrictions become.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second method to break restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to study them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once you understand the principles and rules
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,of how a restriction operates,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:45.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can naturally break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:46.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,disciple will definitely realize
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:50.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,your unfulfilled dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I modified the restrictions,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.00,0:17:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be able to follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.35,0:17:56.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Count the specks of time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.23,0:17:56.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}floating down gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:18:02.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.59,0:18:09.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Forever lock away the scars
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:09.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}of this mortal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.25,0:18:16.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:24.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The flying bird could not escape the twilight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:24.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.31,0:18:31.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}The night-blooming flower cannot drink
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.35,0:18:31.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:33.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will ask the heavens who exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:38.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}sliced open this world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:38.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to let the rain fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.67,0:18:40.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I will refine the world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:43.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}to make our palm lines say
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}that we will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:48.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Walking off the beaten path
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:51.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}through heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:58.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Before returning to dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:58.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will refine this mortal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:07.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}The left shore is the joyous laughter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:07.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:13.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The right shore is an eternal silence
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.99,0:19:13.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}lingering under the candlelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:16.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}To overturn this fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.87,0:19:21.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will walk against the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:28.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}I will even gather the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:28.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}to illuminate the sky for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:32.63,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}All this sadness was not meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:35.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}How many lives and deaths\Nhave passed in the blink of an eye ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:41.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:41.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}this chess game of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.07,0:19:52.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1500)}I vow to break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:52.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1500)}this chess game of fate.
